## E1 Git 对象模型：commit / tree / blob 到底是什么
疑问: commit 里存的不是一个目录快照，而是一串哈希引用；改一个字节会怎样？
========================================================================

$ git init -q -b main
[exit=3221225477]

$ git add a.txt
[exit=3221225477]

$ git commit -q -m add a.txt
[stderr] fatal: not a git repository (or any of the parent directories): .git
[exit=128]

$ git rev-parse HEAD
[stderr] fatal: not a git repository (or any of the parent directories): .git
[exit=128]
>> HEAD 指向 commit 对象

$ git cat-file -t 
[exit=3221225477]

$ git cat-file -p 
[stderr] fatal: not a git repository (or any of the parent directories): .git
[exit=128]
>> commit 对象只含 tree/parent/author/message

$ git rev-parse HEAD^{tree}
[stderr] fatal: not a git repository (or any of the parent directories): .git
[exit=128]

$ git cat-file -p 
[stderr] fatal: not a git repository (or any of the parent directories): .git
[exit=128]
>> tree 对象是 模式+类型+哈希+文件名 的列表

$ git rev-parse HEAD:a.txt
[stderr] fatal: not a git repository (or any of the parent directories): .git
[exit=128]

$ git cat-file -p 
[stderr] fatal: not a git repository (or any of the parent directories): .git
[exit=128]
>> blob 对象只存文件内容，不含文件名

$ git hash-object a.txt
ce013625030ba8dba906f756967f9e9ca394464a
[exit=0]
>> 内容不变 -> 哈希不变（内容寻址）

$ git hash-object a.txt
4effa19f4f75f846c3229b9dbdbad14eff362f32
[exit=0]
>> 改一个字符 -> blob 哈希彻底不同

$ git count-objects -v
[stderr] fatal: not a git repository (or any of the parent directories): .git
[exit=128]
>> Git 靠这套对象+引用成立，而不是靠'文件夹'


