## E3 分支 + 合并冲突：冲突标记长什么样、怎么收尾
疑问: 两个人改同一行必然冲突，冲突文件到底该怎么读？
========================================================================

$ git init -q -b main
[exit=3221225477]

$ git add .
[stderr] fatal: not a git repository (or any of the parent directories): .git
[exit=128]

$ git commit -q -m base config
[stderr] fatal: not a git repository (or any of the parent directories): .git
[exit=128]

$ git switch -c feature-a
[stderr] fatal: not a git repository (or any of the parent directories): .git
[exit=128]

$ git commit -qam feature-a: timeout 60
[stderr] fatal: not a git repository (or any of the parent directories): .git
[exit=128]

$ git switch main
[stderr] fatal: not a git repository (or any of the parent directories): .git
[exit=128]

$ git commit -qam main: retry 5
[stderr] fatal: not a git repository (or any of the parent directories): .git
[exit=128]

$ git merge feature-a --no-edit
[stderr] fatal: not a git repository (or any of the parent directories): .git
[exit=128]
>> 冲突返回非 0，这不是 bug

$ git status -sb
[stderr] fatal: not a git repository (or any of the parent directories): .git
[exit=128]

--- 冲突后的 config.ini 真实内容 ---
timeout=30
retry=5

--- end ---

$ git add config.ini
[stderr] fatal: not a git repository (or any of the parent directories): .git
[exit=128]
>> 手工合并两边的意图后再 add

$ git commit -q --no-edit -m merge feature-a
[stderr] fatal: not a git repository (or any of the parent directories): .git
[exit=128]

$ git log --graph --oneline --decorate
[stderr] fatal: not a git repository (or any of the parent directories): .git
[exit=128]
>> 三方合并产生两个 parent


