## E5 reset 与 revert：为什么共享分支只能用 revert
疑问: 误提交一行密码到 main，删掉那行有几种做法，哪种不会伤到别人？
========================================================================

$ git init -q -b main
[exit=0]

$ git add .
[stderr] warning: in the working copy of 'conf.py', LF will be replaced by CRLF the next time Git touches it
[exit=0]

$ git commit -q -m add config (with secret)
[exit=0]

$ git commit -qam remove secret
[stderr] warning: in the working copy of 'conf.py', LF will be replaced by CRLF the next time Git touches it
[exit=0]

$ git rev-parse HEAD~1
0860e999ba6cca16271860983c4d9427ac17798d
[exit=0]

$ git reset --soft HEAD~1
[exit=0]
>> soft: 只动 HEAD，改动留在暂存区

$ git status -sb
## main
M  conf.py
[exit=0]

$ git reset --hard 0860e999ba6cca16271860983c4d9427ac17798d
HEAD is now at 0860e99 add config (with secret)
[exit=0]
>> 回到含密码的那个提交（模拟历史里已经有它）

$ git reset --mixed HEAD
[exit=0]
>> mixed: 动 HEAD+暂存区，工作区不变

$ git status -sb
## main
[exit=0]

$ git reset --hard 0860e999ba6cca16271860983c4d9427ac17798d
HEAD is now at 0860e99 add config (with secret)
[exit=0]

$ git revert --no-edit HEAD
[main 355b0f3] Revert "add config (with secret)"
 Date: Tue Nov 17 12:59:29 2026 +0800
 1 file changed, 2 deletions(-)
 delete mode 100644 conf.py
[exit=0]
>> 共享分支正确做法：revert 生成反向提交

$ git log --oneline -3
355b0f3 Revert "add config (with secret)"
0860e99 add config (with secret)
[exit=0]
>> 历史保留，两条记录都在（明文仍在历史里！）

$ git log -p -1
commit 355b0f3d67ae7a9e83181d04d0309837c3c2622d
Author: C5A Lab <lab@example.com>
Date:   Tue Nov 17 12:59:29 2026 +0800

    Revert "add config (with secret)"
    
    This reverts commit 0860e999ba6cca16271860983c4d9427ac17798d.

diff --git a/conf.py b/conf.py
deleted file mode 100644
index fd6510e..0000000
--- a/conf.py
+++ /dev/null
@@ -1,2 +0,0 @@
-user='app'
-password='s3cr3t'
[exit=0]
>> revert 只是抵消，不是抹除

>> 关键结论: reset 改写历史（只能用于未共享的本地分支）；
>> revert 追加历史（可用于已推送/被他人拉取的分支）。
>> 真正的密钥泄露要靠吊销凭据 + 历史重写（filter-repo/BFG），revert 不够。


