## E6 .gitignore 为什么不生效
疑问: 明明写进 .gitignore 了，git status 还显示 .env，为什么？
========================================================================

$ git init -q -b main
[exit=0]

$ git add .
[exit=3221225477]

$ git commit -q -m oops: committed .env
On branch main

Initial commit

Untracked files:
  (use "git add <file>..." to include in what will be committed)
	.env
	app.py

nothing added to commit but untracked files present (use "git add" to track)
[exit=1]

$ git add .gitignore
[stderr] warning: in the working copy of '.gitignore', LF will be replaced by CRLF the next time Git touches it
[exit=0]

$ git commit -q -m add gitignore
[exit=0]

$ git status -sb --ignored
## main
?? app.py
!! .env
[exit=0]
>> 已跟踪的文件不受 .gitignore 影响

$ git check-ignore -v .env
.gitignore:1:.env	.env
[exit=0]
>> check-ignore 说它被规则命中

$ git ls-files .env
[exit=0]
>> 但它依然在索引里 -> 这就是原因

$ git rm --cached .env
[stderr] fatal: pathspec '.env' did not match any files
[exit=128]
>> 从索引移除，保留本地文件

$ git commit -q -m untrack .env
On branch main
Untracked files:
  (use "git add <file>..." to include in what will be committed)
	app.py

nothing added to commit but untracked files present (use "git add" to track)
[exit=1]

$ git status -sb --ignored
[exit=3221225477]
>> 现在才真的被忽略


